  "question": {
    "text": "The following mechanism has been proposed for the reaction of $\\mathrm{NO}$ with $\\mathrm{Br}_2$ to form $\\mathrm{NOBr}$ : $\\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g})+\\mathrm{Br}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{NOBr}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$\n$$\n\\mathrm{NOBr}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{NO}(\\mathrm{g}) \\longrightarrow 2 \\mathrm{NOBr}(\\mathrm{g})\n$$\nIf the second step is the rate determining step, the order of the reaction with respect to $N O(g)$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "gJ7A3",
      "text": "\n1\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
